    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "그거 말고 또 다른 특징이……. 다른 특징……."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "아, 있어."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"오, 있구나! 그게 뭐야?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "그 구름, 선생님과 비슷한 느낌이었어. "
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "응, 선생님 같았어."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s9] \"????\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s10] \"……나, 같았다고?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "응~ 해님같이 따끈따끈하고. 좋은 냄새도 나고~ 같이 있으면 행복한 기분도 들어서~"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "응~ 해님같이 따끈따끈하고. 좋은 냄새도 나고~ 같이 있으면 행복한 기분도 들어서~"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "엄청 좋아해."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s11] \"그, 그렇구나.\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s12] \"치세가 본 구름 이야기 하는 거…… 맞지?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "응, 내가 본 구름 이야기. 맞아~"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "응, 내가 본 구름 이야기. 맞아~"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "오늘 이렇게나 날씨 좋으니까~ 오늘이라면 찾을 수 있지 않을까~?"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "찾을 수 있었으면 좋겠는데……."
    },
    {
      "Text": "(그렇게 치세와 함께 한참을 구름을 찾아 돌아다녔지만. 마땅한 소득 없이 해가 저물었다.)"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"구름은, 결국 못 찾았네.\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "응."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"괜찮아, 기회는 오늘만 있는 게 아니니까. 다음번에 또…….\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "(지그---시)"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"치세……?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "(지그---------시)"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"치세, 뭘 그렇게 보고 있는 거야?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "솜사탕……."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"솜사탕?\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"혹시, 솜사탕이 먹고 싶은 거면……. 사줄까?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "(끄덕)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3935724207,
      "Name": "노점상 아저씨",
      "Text": "구매해주셔서 감사합니다!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "냠."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"어때, 맛있어?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "응."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s13] \"다행이다.\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s14] \"구름은 못 찾았지만, 그건 다음에 다시 같이 찾으면 될 테니까.\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "응……. 하웁, 냠냠."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"근데, 결국 그 구름은 뭐였던 거야?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "우음, 설명하기, 힘들어."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "그치만, 괜찮아……."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "이 구름도, 마음에 드니까."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"구름?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "모양과, 느낌은 조금 다르지만. 선생님이 사준……."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "맛있는 구름이니까."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"……?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "아……."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "양손이 끈적끈적해졌어. 선생님."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"아, 잠깐만, 치세 손을 닦을 티슈가 분명 여기 어딘가에……\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "치세",
      "Text": "음~ 끈적거리지 않게 남은 솜사탕은 물에 씻어서 먹어야겠다."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"……아니, 아무리 그래도 그건 아니지!\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "(직후 끈적거리는 손을 닦겠다며 달려가려는 치세를 필사적으로 막았다.)"
    }
  ],
  "DialogEN": [
    {
      "Text": "The Scent of Clouds"
    },
    {
      "Text": "As I arrived at the shopping area, I saw Chise walking around aimlessly."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"Chise, what are you doing?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Ah, Sensei. You're here?"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"You look like you're just wandering around.\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Well..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Uh, I was chasing a cloud."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"A cloud?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Ah, there, it's moving again."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Sensei, we have to chase it."
    },
    {
      "Text": "Chise started walking slowly after a drifting cloud."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"Uh, hold up, Chise! Wait!\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "The cloud..."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"Is that the cloud you're looking for?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "No, it's different."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "The cloud I'm looking for is a little...softer."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "It's light and fluffy, Sensei."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"Clouds...clouds...\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "..."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"Chise, wait!\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "I walked all over chasing after Chise, who was drifting around like the wind."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Not here, either..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Not here, either."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Hmm..."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"Chise, hold on a minute!\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Hmm? Sensei? What's the matter?"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s1] \"Maybe you should give it a rest.\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s2] \"What kind of cloud are you looking for, exactly?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "The kind of cloud I'm looking for..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "The kind of cloud I'm looking for..."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"If you just tell me, we can find it faster.\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Good point. With your help, Sensei..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "...I think we can find it."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "So, the kind of cloud I'm looking for...is..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Well..."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"Well...?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "It's a soft cloud."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s3] \"Soft. Right. You already said that.\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s4] \"It was a soft cloud. And?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "And..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "And..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "It had a great smell to it."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s5] \"Of course, it had a great smell.\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s6] \"...Wait. Huh? Smell?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Yup."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Yup."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "The scent made me feel like I was floating through the soft clouds in the sky."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"Well, could you explain in more detail...\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "More detail..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Uh."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "It smells like the shining sun over our heads."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s7] \"Smells like the sun...\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s8] \"Is there anything else I can go by?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Anything else... Some other characteristic... "
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Anything else... Some other characteristic... "
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Ah, there's one other thing."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"Oh! What is it?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "The cloud felt like you."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Yup, it was just like you."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s9] \"Huh?\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s10] \"Felt like me?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Yeah! It's warm like the sunshine and smells so incredibly good. I feel great just being around it!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Yeah! It's warm like the sunshine and smells so incredibly good. I feel great just being around it!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "I liked it a lot."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s11] \"I see.\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s12] \"You mean the cloud you saw...right?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Yeah, of course I'm talking about the cloud!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Yeah, of course I'm talking about the cloud!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "The weather is so great today! I think we might find it!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "It'd be great if we did..."
    },
    {
      "Text": "I wandered around with Chise looking for the cloud. The sun set before we could find it."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"I guess we're not going to find the cloud.\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"It's fine, there's always tomorrow. Next time...\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "(stare)"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"Chise...?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "(staaare)"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"Chise, what are you staring at?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Cotton candy..."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"Cotton candy?\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"If you want cotton candy...I can buy you some.\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "(nod)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3935724207,
      "Name": "Street Vendor",
      "Text": "Thank you!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Nom nom."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"How is it? Good?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Oh yeah."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s13] \"That's great.\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s14] \"We didn't find the cloud, but there's always next time.\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Yup... Nom nom nom."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"By the way, what's with that cloud you were looking for?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "It's hard to explain."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "But that's fine..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "This cloud, I like this one too."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"A cloud?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "The shape and texture is a little different, but..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "You sure know how to buy the tastiest clouds."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"...?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Ah..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "My hand is all sticky, Sensei."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"Oh, wait. I have something around here you can use...\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "Chise",
      "Text": "Hmm. I should wash the rest of the cotton candy so it's not so sticky."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"...No, don't do that!\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "After that I tried desperately to keep Chise from wiping her hands on my clothes."
    }
  ],
  "DialogTH": [
    {
      "Text": "กลิ่นเมฆ"
    },
    {
      "Text": "(มาถึงย่านการค้าก็เห็นชิเซะกำลังเดินเหม่ออยู่)"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"ชิเซะ ทำอะไรอยู่.....?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "ชิเซะ",
      "Text": "อ๊ะ คุณครูมาแล้วเหรอ?"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"ครูเห็นเธอเดินไปเดินมาสักพักแล้วล่ะ\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "ชิเซะ",
      "Text": "คือว่า..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "ชิเซะ",
      "Text": "ฉันกำลังไล่ตามก้อนเมฆอยู่น่ะ"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"เมฆเหรอ?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "ชิเซะ",
      "Text": "อ๊ะ มันขยับอีกแล้ว"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "ชิเซะ",
      "Text": "คุณครูคะ เราต้องรีบตามมันไปนะ"
    },
    {
      "Text": "(ชิเซะเริ่มออกเดินตามเมฆที่ลอยไปเรื่อยๆ)"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"อ๊ะ เดี๋ยวก่อนชิเซะ รอด้วย!\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "ชิเซะ",
      "Text": "ก้อนเมฆ...."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"นั่นใช่ก้อนเมฆที่ชิเซะตามหาอยู่รึเปล่า?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "ชิเซะ",
      "Text": "ไม่ใช่ มันไม่เหมือนกัน"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "ชิเซะ",
      "Text": "ก้อนเมฆที่ฉันตามหา... มันจะดูนุ่มนิ่มกว่าหน่อย"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "ชิเซะ",
      "Text": "ฟ้าจ๋าฟ้า~ ลอยละล่อง~ คุณครู"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"ฟ้าจ๋าฟ้า...\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "ชิเซะ",
      "Text": "......"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"รอเดี๋ยวชิเซะ!\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "(คุณครูเดินตามชิเซะที่ไล่ตามก้อนเมฆไปเรื่อยๆ และเริ่มเดินวนเวียนไปที่ต่างๆ)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "ชิเซะ",
      "Text": "ที่นี่ก็ไม่ใช่..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "ชิเซะ",
      "Text": "ที่นี่ก็ไม่มี"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "ชิเซะ",
      "Text": "อืม~"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"ชิเซะ หยุดก่อน!\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4099878918,
      "Name": "ชิเซะ",
      "Text": "หืม? คุณครู? ทำไมเหรอ?"
